.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "TypeScript"
.PP
\fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP

.PP
\fRTypeScript\fP is a language for application-scale JavaScript\&. TypeScript adds optional types to JavaScript that support tools for large-scale JavaScript applications for any browser, for any host, on any OS\&. TypeScript compiles to readable, standards-based JavaScript\&. Try it out at the \fRplayground\fP, and stay up to date via \fRour blog\fP and \fRTwitter account\fP\&.

.PP
Find others who are using TypeScript at \fRour community page\fP\&.
.SH "Installing"
.PP
For the latest stable version:

.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install \-D typescript
.fi
.PP

.PP
For our nightly builds:

.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install \-D typescript@next
.fi
.PP
